<title>USA: Pride shareholders approved acquisition.</title>
<headline>Pride shareholders approved acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pride Petroleum Services Inc said its shareholders have approved the firm's aquisition of the operating subsidiaries of Forasol-Foramer NV.</p>
<p>Shareholders also agreed to increase the number of authorized shares of Pride common stock from 40 million to 100 million.</p>
<p>Approval by Pride's shareholders satisfies one of the last major conditions to the closing of the transaction, which will involve the issuance of about 11.1 million shares of Pride common stock and a cash payment by Pride of about $113.2 million.</p>
<p>Following the closing of the transaction, which is now set for March 10, Forasol-Foramer will receive 0.66 shares of Pride common stock and $6.80 in cash for each common share in Forasol-Foramer held by them.</p>
</text>
